    <p class="eyebrow">Get started</p>
    <h1>From folders of notes to agents that read them</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      This walkthrough starts with the smallest setup — a local stdio server for Claude Code — then moves to the
      Docker image with a token, the web UI and its folders, and ends with a hook that adds related notes to every
      turn. The
      screenshots show the web UI in light mode.
    </p>
